1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:00,863
Kamu Qin Shuang,

2
00:00:01,266 --> 00:00:02,206
cuma itu yang kuakui.

3
00:00:04,427 --> 00:00:06,374
Poin suka Qin Shuang,

4
00:00:06,443 --> 00:00:08,368
plus empat, lima puluh dua.

5
00:00:08,759 --> 00:00:10,493
Bodoh.

6
00:00:10,556 --> 00:00:12,791
Cuma orang bodoh yang yakin.

7
00:00:12,871 --> 00:00:14,230
Aku bilang aku yatim prajurit,

8
00:00:15,259 --> 00:00:16,024
itu bohong.

9
00:00:17,223 --> 00:00:17,551
Keluarga jenderal,

10
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,634
juga keluarga prajurit, kan?

11
00:00:19,715 --> 00:00:21,614
Menyembunyikan putri pesakitan,

12
00:00:21,718 --> 00:00:22,270
kamu nggak takut?

13
00:00:23,381 --> 00:00:24,047
Takut.

14
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,578
Takut kamu kabur.

15
00:00:25,648 --> 00:00:27,539
Soal aku putri pesakitan,

16
00:00:27,608 --> 00:00:28,353
jangan sampai orang ketiga tahu.

17
00:00:29,288 --> 00:00:30,620
Mulutku rapat.

18
00:00:34,172 --> 00:00:35,379
Qin Lieshan…

19
00:00:35,453 --> 00:00:36,662
Putri pesakitan?

20
00:00:39,002 --> 00:00:40,388
Ini mahal harganya.

21
00:00:42,612 --> 00:00:43,816
Pengumuman masih dua hari lagi?

22
00:00:44,325 --> 00:00:45,628
Aku nggak sabar!

23
00:00:46,179 --> 00:00:47,603
Daftar itu rahasia,

24
00:00:47,669 --> 00:00:48,650
nggak ada yang bisa lihat.

25
00:00:49,037 --> 00:00:49,675
Rahasia,

26
00:00:50,069 --> 00:00:51,250
semua ada harganya.

27
00:00:53,638 --> 00:00:54,679
Kantor pengumuman dijaga prajurit.

28
00:00:55,563 --> 00:00:56,425
Prajurit jaga pintu,

29
00:00:56,485 --> 00:00:58,085
istri juru tulis jaga dapur.

30
00:00:58,870 --> 00:00:59,475
Gula putih?

31
00:00:59,791 --> 00:01:00,813
Satu kotak penuh?

32
00:01:01,168 --> 00:01:01,678
Lihat sekali,

33
00:01:01,736 --> 00:01:02,876
sekali saja!

34
00:01:05,262 --> 00:01:06,209
Kabupaten Qingshui…

35
00:01:06,574 --> 00:01:06,966
Xu…

36
00:01:07,169 --> 00:01:07,907
Nggak ada?

37
00:01:08,407 --> 00:01:08,809
Sudah belum?

38
00:01:09,181 --> 00:01:09,492
Cepat!

39
00:01:09,911 --> 00:01:12,227
Mengalirkan air dengan kincir air…

40
00:01:12,549 --> 00:01:13,762
Ini esainya dia.

41
00:01:16,923 --> 00:01:17,761
Namamu,

42
00:01:18,446 --> 00:01:19,261
nggak ada di daftar.

43
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:19,878
Nggak ada?

44
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:23,490
Peringkat teratas Wei Xun,

45
00:01:23,919 --> 00:01:27,503
esai kebijakannya tentang kincir air.
